  "summary_intro": {
    "title": "Introduction",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Free-standing jib cranes are typically used in smaller work cell areas for repetitive and unique lifting tasks."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Jib cranes are very versatile and can also be paired with overhead cranes to maximize production efficiency."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The working range is a circular area, making it highly suitable for workplaces with short distances and dense material flow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It offers a substantial lifting capacity and can be used across various industries."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Its lightweight structure occupies minimal space and is easy to install."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "overview": {
    "title": "Overview",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A freestanding jib crane consists of a column, a slewing arm, and an electric hoist."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It proves highly effective in workshops with limited space."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It occupies a very small footprint while covering the entire working area."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Depending on requirements, it can be mounted on the floor or wall, and the lifting mechanism can be electric or manual."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Widely used in various locations such as loading docks, ports, and shipyards, it can be used in conjunction with other jib cranes or as supporting equipment on factory production lines."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The installation and dismantling of the fixed column jib crane are extremely simple, requiring no disassembly."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "introduction": {
    "title": "Introduction",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The freestanding jib crane is designed to stand on its own without any other support."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It consists of a rotatable vertical column and a horizontal load-supporting arm."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We rely not on low jib crane prices but on the high quality of our freestanding jib cranes to achieve our company's growth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Freestanding Jib Crane"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Compared to wall-mounted and wall-traveling jib cranes, the freestanding jib crane can achieve higher capacities, longer spans, and a larger rotation range."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Due to its structural advantages, this jib crane can be customized to meet your specific application requirements."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The only installation constraint is that the soil pressure where the freestanding jib crane is placed must reach 2,500 pounds per square foot."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
